{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13206200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13206200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320620001:1":{"text":"哥哥……铐兰哥哥……？","source_cn":"哥哥……铐兰哥哥……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35D162FFA3AF02C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1320620001":{"text":"哥哥……铐兰哥哥……？","source_cn":"哥哥……铐兰哥哥……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35D162FFA3AF02C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320620002:0":{"text":"铐兰哥哥……是他，我知道是他。","source_cn":"铐兰哥哥……是他，我知道是他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x173E883E93D940C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320620003:1":{"text":"他曾经比我高一个头，肩膀宽厚又结实。很小的时候，他一只手就能把我举起，让我能看清树上的夜莺。","source_cn":"他曾经比我高一个头，肩膀宽厚又结实。很小的时候，他一只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB2BA3B4668130F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320620004:0":{"text":"现在他蜷缩在这么窄小的地方，枕着冰凉的石板……","source_cn":"现在他蜷缩在这么窄小的地方，枕着冰凉的石板……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A2BE61A9BA95F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320620005:1":{"text":"卡列琳娜小姐，这封信上写着，“大魔法师给害怕的小卡莎制造了世界上最厉害的机械人偶，于是，小卡莎不再害怕了。”","source_cn":"卡列琳娜小姐，这封信上写着，“大魔法师给害怕的小卡莎制...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49F1B545F04307C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:6::2":{"text":"铐兰的信纸","source_cn":"铐兰的信纸","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6B0E959FFFA90E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320620006:0":{"text":"之前那本《魔法师与冒险家》，也是他为你写的书吗？","source_cn":"之前那本《魔法师与冒险家》，也是他为你写的书吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC07709171160C3EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320620007:0":{"text":"是的……我小时候怕黑爱哭，哥哥就爱编写童话故事安慰我，在他的故事里，他是大魔法师，而我是一个小小的冒险家，他什么都能做到，而且总是能保护我。","source_cn":"是的……我小时候怕黑爱哭，哥哥就爱编写童话故事安慰我，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34A9679842A85AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320620008:1":{"text":"我十三岁时离开家，去修道院侍奉艾雅女神了。哥哥在家中和父亲一起处理文书，接受成为魔法师的专业训练。","source_cn":"我十三岁时离开家，去修道院侍奉艾雅女神了。哥哥在家中和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D01284F92C8A629","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320620009:1":{"text":"但是哥哥志不在此。比起魔法，他更喜欢办读书会，和朋友一起发明些有趣又精细的小东西。","source_cn":"但是哥哥志不在此。比起魔法，他更喜欢办读书会，和朋友一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B40616DFA56A96C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320620010:1":{"text":"每次通信，哥哥信里都会附上他新读的书单。最后的那几封信，他写到自己新结交了一些矮人朋友，说在和他们做能改变世界的造物。","source_cn":"每次通信，哥哥信里都会附上他新读的书单。最后的那几封信...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50DCCB32B153F94C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320620011:1":{"text":"但是之后，魔物如潮水一般袭来……","source_cn":"但是之后，魔物如潮水一般袭来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A29D085FCC3FAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1320620011":{"text":"但是之后，魔物如潮水一般袭来……","source_cn":"但是之后，魔物如潮水一般袭来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A29D085FCC3FAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320620013:1":{"text":"那段时间的记忆模糊不清了……魔物攻破了修道院的院门，我受了伤……在大火和尖叫声中，哥哥来了，他带着我从修道院后门逃跑，把我推入家族出资修葺的密道中。","source_cn":"那段时间的记忆模糊不清了……魔物攻破了修道院的院门，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB82B4898D20D9196","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320620014:1":{"text":"他说他会像书中的大魔法师一样保护我，让我不要回头，沿着密道一路跑回庄园，管家先生会带我去避难处。","source_cn":"他说他会像书中的大魔法师一样保护我，让我不要回头，沿着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0C53A4E6F23251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320620015:1":{"text":"但是，周围突然变冷了，浓重的黑暗淹没了我……","source_cn":"但是，周围突然变冷了，浓重的黑暗淹没了我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7850FA07110CFA37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320620016:1":{"text":"那是你记忆中最后的画面吗？","source_cn":"那是你记忆中最后的画面吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0CD2A0C432F423A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320620017:1":{"text":"不，我清醒了一瞬，巨大的爆炸声……肉被碾碎的声音……刺骨的疼痛……","source_cn":"不，我清醒了一瞬，巨大的爆炸声……肉被碾碎的声音……刺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8D0528C183150F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320620018:1":{"text":"最后，我——我看到了，哥哥站在我面前。","source_cn":"最后，我——我看到了，哥哥站在我面前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27111D8A37CE1F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320620019:1":{"text":"当时他已经是机械人偶的模样，我好疼，好害怕，但是他向我伸出了手，喊我“小卡莎”……","source_cn":"当时他已经是机械人偶的模样，我好疼，好害怕，但是他向我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA03318601D57D425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320620020:1":{"text":"就在那个时刻，我知道，不管变成了什么模样，摸起来有多冰凉，他就是铐兰哥哥！","source_cn":"就在那个时刻，我知道，不管变成了什么模样，摸起来有多冰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC6B3B01CF8E28FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320620021:1":{"text":"闭上眼睛吧，回想起铐兰生前的样子。那才是他真实的模样。","source_cn":"闭上眼睛吧，回想起铐兰生前的样子。那才是他真实的模样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59A269D7043015C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320620022:1":{"text":"子爵先生……","source_cn":"子爵先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x026089CA2BE3EE04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1320620023:1":{"text":"千百年来，对父母和亲友的回忆维系着我的理性。","source_cn":"千百年来，对父母和亲友的回忆维系着我的理性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0D57BD9379D202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1320620024:1":{"text":"你一定要学会回忆，只有如此才能维持自我。而你思念的人将以最好的姿态永远存在于你盛大的回忆中。","source_cn":"你一定要学会回忆，只有如此才能维持自我。而你思念的人将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8A6E3D718FD7455","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1320620025:1":{"text":"谢谢你，先生。但我不会再闭上双眼了，因为我的盲目，才让哥哥的灵魂饱受折磨。","source_cn":"谢谢你，先生。但我不会再闭上双眼了，因为我的盲目，才让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD152DFE5DAA187B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1320620026:1":{"text":"即便重归孤独，我也要让哥哥的灵魂回归安宁。","source_cn":"即便重归孤独，我也要让哥哥的灵魂回归安宁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58D794527D24CF73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1320620027:1":{"text":"请帮我……把他带回去，解放他的灵魂吧。","source_cn":"请帮我……把他带回去，解放他的灵魂吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x560EF2FB85957DD1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"请帮我……把他带回去，解放他的灵魂吧。","female":"请帮我……把他带回去，解放他的灵魂吧。","variant_male_record_index":"145886","variant_female_record_index":"145887","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"之后呢？","source_cn":"之后呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x444E3B2F403759DD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"之后呢？","female":"之后呢？","variant_male_record_index":"68794","variant_female_record_index":"68795","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1320620012:1":{"text":"我想……是的。","source_cn":"我想……是的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B6E54DDF382A716","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我想……是的。","female":"我想……是的。","variant_male